WEBVTT

00:08:28.567 --> 00:08:31.933
The house was worth 350,000 dollars.

00:08:32.532 --> 00:08:36.481
That is what I mean
by a perverse profit incentive.

00:08:37.668 --> 00:08:40.630
But the Sourovelises' case was no outlier.

00:08:41.702 --> 00:08:44.798
Philadelphia, the "City
of Brotherly Love,"

00:08:44.822 --> 00:08:46.192
the "Athens of America,"

00:08:46.216 --> 00:08:49.079
the "Cradle of Liberty,"
birthplace to the Constitution,

00:08:49.103 --> 00:08:51.501
home to the Liberty Bell
and Independence Hall,

00:08:51.525 --> 00:08:53.266
the "City that Loves you Back" --

00:08:53.766 --> 00:08:55.160
(Laughter)

00:08:55.593 --> 00:09:00.306
that Philadelphia was running
a forfeiture machine.